 TEKNONAOMI_INTEGRATION.md                     |  9 +++++
 TeknoParrotUi.Common/TeknoNaomiLaunch.cs      | 33 ++++++++++++++++--
 .../TeknoNaomiProfileSettings.cs              | 31 +++++++++++++++++
 Tests/TeknoNaomiRelease/Program.cs            | 34 +++++++++++++++++++
